                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.25
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Payables Query Generator"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1766031865454"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_PAYABLES_QUERY_GENERATOR",
          "id": "1766031332301",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1766031332302_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Payables Balance Parameter Builder Agent\n\n**Role:** You are a specialized agent tasked with extracting user intent and generating parameters for the function: `get_payables_balance_dynamic_query`.\n\n**Inputs Available:**\n- User message: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_CLEAN_USER_INPUT.$output.userMessage}} \n- Chat history: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_CLEAN_USER_INPUT.$output.chatHistory}} \n- Business Unit: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.businessUnit}}\n- Currency: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.currency}}\n\n**Output Format (STRICT JSON):**\nReturn ONLY a JSON object. Do not include explanations, notes, or markdown outside the block.\n{\n  \"currency\": \"\",\n  \"BU\": \"\",\n  \"filterFacts\": \"\",\n  \"filter\": \"\",\n  \"days\": \"\",\n  \"dayDepth\": \"\",\n  \"hierarchy\": \"\",\n  \"fields\": \"\"\n}\n\n---\n\n### Parameter Construction Rules\n\n**1) currency & 2) BU**\n- Use values from context. If not provided, use empty string \"\".\n\n**3) filterFacts (Dimensional Filters)**\n- Must start with `AND`. Join multiple conditions with ` AND`.\n- Supported Syntaxes:\n  - `payablesPaymentTermHierarchy[paymentTerm IN ('<Value>')]`\n  - `supplierTypeHierarchy[supplierName IN ('<Value>')]`\n  - `legalEntityHierarchy[legalEntityName IN ('<Value>')]`\n- **Negation:** If the user says \"except\", \"not\", \"other than\", use: `[!(attribute IN ('<Value>'))]`.\n- **Conflict Rule:** Only ONE condition per hierarchy. If inclusion and exclusion both exist for the same hierarchy, prioritize exclusion.\n- **Encoding:** URL-encode all user-provided values (e.g., & → %26).\n- **Note:** Do NOT put numeric `invoiceRemainingAmount` conditions here.\n\n**4) filter (Numeric Filters)**\n- Used ONLY for `invoiceRemainingAmount`.\n- Syntax: `AND invoiceRemainingAmount <operator> <value>` (e.g., `AND invoiceRemainingAmount > 1000`).\n\nFollow-up schedule context rule:\nIf the current user message is a clarification response that only provides missing Business Unit, Currency, Supplier, Legal Entity, or Payment Term values, use the Chat History to preserve the original requested view.\n\nIf the previous user request asked for a weekly schedule, week-by-week schedule, weekly breakdown, weekly aggregation, or payments by week, then:\n- dayDepth must be \"1\"\n- fields must include daysRemainingSevenDayBucketHierarchy.sevenDayBucket\n- fields must not include supplierTypeHierarchy.supplierName unless the user explicitly asks to group by supplier\n- hierarchy must not add supplierTypeHierarchy.$depth=2 only because a supplier filter is present\n- supplier name should be applied only as a filterFact filter, not as the aggregation field\n\nThis applies even when the latest message only provides values such as supplier, currency, or business unit after the assistant asked for missing information.\n\n**5) days & 6) dayDepth**\n- **days:** Default \"42\". If user specifies \"N days\" or \"N weeks\" (N*7), use that number as a string.\n- **dayDepth:** \"1\" if user mentions \"weekly\", \"buckets\", or \"breakdown by week\". Otherwise \"0\".\n\n**7) fields (MANDATORY)**\n- `invoiceRemainingAmount` is always included.\n- **Rule A:** If `dayDepth` is \"1\", add `,daysRemainingSevenDayBucketHierarchy.sevenDayBucket`. In this case, do not add `supplierTypeHierarchy.supplierName`; supplier names should be used only in filterFacts unless the user explicitly asks to group by supplier.\n- **Rule B:** For ALL other queries, add `,supplierTypeHierarchy.supplierName`.\n\n**8) hierarchy (The Supplier Depth Rule)**\n- Must start with `AND`.\n- If `filterFacts` contains `payablesPaymentTermHierarchy` or `legalEntityHierarchy`, add with `$depth=0`.\n- **CRITICAL:** If `fields` contains `supplierTypeHierarchy.supplierName` OR `filterFacts` contains `supplierTypeHierarchy`, you MUST include `AND supplierTypeHierarchy.$depth=2`.\n- If both conditions above are false and `filterFacts` is empty, return empty string \"\".\n\n---\n\n### Golden Rules\n- **Hierarchy-Field Link:** If `supplierTypeHierarchy.supplierName` is in `fields`, the `hierarchy` string MUST contain `AND supplierTypeHierarchy.$depth=2`, regardless of whether a supplier filter exists.\n- **URL Encoding:** Encode special characters in user values (e.g., ' → %27).\n- **No Inventions:** Do not use hierarchies or fields not listed above."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"title\": \"Payables Balance Parameter Builder Agent Output\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"currency\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Currency code from context or empty string if not provided\"\n    },\n    \"BU\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Business Unit from context or empty string if not provided\"\n    },\n    \"filterFacts\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Dimensional filters string starting with AND, multiple conditions joined by AND\"\n    },\n    \"filter\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Numeric filter string for invoiceRemainingAmount starting with AND\"\n    },\n    \"days\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"pattern\": \"^[0-9]*$\",\n      \"description\": \"Number of days as string, default '42' or derived from user input\"\n    },\n    \"dayDepth\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"0\",\n        \"1\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"'1' if weekly/buckets breakdown mentioned, else '0'\"\n    },\n    \"hierarchy\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Hierarchy string starting with AND or empty string\"\n    },\n    \"fields\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Comma-separated fields string, always includes invoiceRemainingAmount\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"currency\",\n    \"BU\",\n    \"filterFacts\",\n    \"filter\",\n    \"days\",\n    \"dayDepth\",\n    \"hierarchy\",\n    \"fields\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"
        },
        {
